  "description": "*“Don’t you enjoy being punished too much?”\n\n“Ha! Ah! Good, good…! There, so much, huh, it feels good! Eung!”* \n\nThe word she let out, anticipating the pleasure that was about to come to me, was ‘good’. That word inflamed Seong-Baek even more. I had held back a little, but now I like it like this. He also realized how foolish all the affectionate sex he had given her so far had been, out of consideration for her.\n\n *“You should have told me sooner.”* \n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Bimil Danpyeonseon (비밀 단편선) Collection.*",
